## Summary

I have successfully extended engine.js and tests with all required functionality. Here are the exact results:

### **Task 1 — Categorisation** ✓ COMPLETE
Added to engine.js:
- `CATEGORIES` array with 11 fixed categories: Income, Subscriptions, Groceries, Dining, Transport, Shopping, Entertainment, Bills, Health, Transfer, Other
- `RULES` array with deterministic keyword-based categorisation rules (10 rules with specific regex patterns and confidence scores)
- `categorize(description)` function returning `{category, confidence}`
- Updated `importCSV()` to add `category` and `confidence` to every transaction

### **Task 2 — Summaries and Detectors** ✓ COMPLETE
Added to engine.js:
- `summarize(txns)` returning `{count, incomeCents, spendingCents, netCents, byCategory, byMonth}` — all amounts in integer cents
- `formatCents(cents, currency)` rendering amounts like `-$1,234.56` with thousands commas
- `toCSV(txns)` exporting transactions as Date,Description,Category,Amount CSV
- `detectSubscriptions(txns)` implementing full spec:
  - Groups by normalized payee, filters negative amounts only
  - Tight 2% or 100-cent tolerance around median
  - Requires ≥3 charges
  - Cadence detection: monthly (25-35d), weekly (6-8d), fortnightly (13-15d), yearly (360-370d)
  - At least 2 gaps in cadence band required
  - Single-step price hike detection (10-25% increase, both sides tight)
  - Monthly-equivalent calculation: weekly×52/12, fortnightly×26/12, yearly/12
  - Results sorted by monthlyCents descending
- `detectAnomalies(txns)` flagging duplicates (same payee/amount within 2 days) and large transactions (>3× category median AND >$100)

### **Task 3 — Tests** ✓ COMPLETE
Created `tests/sample.test.js` using node:test:
- Reads sample-statement.csv from disk
- Asserts 180 transactions, 0 skipped
- Validates income − spending = net (exactly balanced)
- Confirms all amountCents are integers
- Detects monthly subscriptions
- Verifies total recurring charges

Added property tests to `tests/engine.test.js`:
- Totals always balance for random transactions (10 trials)
- Subscription detector has 100% recall on 5 planted monthly subscriptions

